Hi,

CIP kernel team has released Linux kernel v4.19.72-cip10 and v4.4.192-cip37.

The linux-4.19.y-cip tree has been updated from base version from 4.19.66 to 4.19.72,
And added updating pinctrl, support r8a774a1 SoC, HopeRun RZ/G2[M] boards and others.

The linux-4.4.y-cip tree has been updated from base version from 4.4.188 to 4.4.192, 
and added support for USB of r8a77470, r8a7744 and these reference boards.

You can get this release via the git tree at:

  v4.19.72-cip10:

    repository: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/cip/linux-cip.git
    branch: linux-4.19.y-cip
    commit: c2f78bed33cbb70de3fcfa6ae02b607c8c211669

  v4.4.192-cip37:

    repository: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/cip/linux-cip.git
    branch: linux-4.4.y-cip
    commit: 2d85c707002916257a0c113698e72057f2f751c9

